@startuml Browser OIDC Authentication Flow
autonumber
skinparam actorStyle AWESOME

skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Practitioner" as User
box "Client Side" #F4F9FF
    participant "Browser / UI" as Browser
    participant "Angular Core" as Angular
end box

box "Edge Gateway Boundary" #FFFDF0
    participant "Nginx Gateway" as Nginx
    participant "oauth2-proxy" as Proxy
end box

box "Identity & Backend Core" #FAFAFA
    participant "Keycloak IdP" as KC
    participant "Node.js BFF" as BFF
    participant "Redis Session" as Redis
end box

== 1. Gateway-Mediated OIDC Flow ==
User -> Browser : Access Practitioner Dashboard
Browser -> Angular : Route Initialization
Angular -> Nginx : GET /api/dashboard (Request UI/Data assets)
Nginx -> Proxy : Verify Edge Session Cookie

alt Edge Session Missing / Invalid
    Proxy --> Nginx : 401 Unauthorized / Redirect
    Nginx --> Browser : HTTP 302 Redirect to Keycloak Auth URL
    Browser -> KC : GET /auth (With PKCE Challenge & Client ID)
    User <-> KC : Present Credentials + Resolve Multi-Factor Challenge
    KC --> Browser : Return HTTP 302 Authorization Code
    Browser -> Nginx : GET /oauth2/callback?code=<auth_code>
    Nginx -> Proxy : Process Authorization Callback
    Proxy -> KC : POST /token (Exchange Code + PKCE Verifier)
    KC --> Proxy : Issue signed JWTs (Access, Refresh, ID Token)
    Proxy -> Proxy : Encrypt tokens into secure Gateway Session Cookie
    Proxy --> Nginx : Inject Session Header Assets
    Nginx --> Browser : Set-Cookie (Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax) + Redirect
end

== 2. Post-Auth Context Verification ==
Browser -> Angular : Load Dashboard Router
Angular -> Nginx : GET /auth/me (Forward Gateway Cookie)
Nginx -> Proxy : Validate Cookie & Hydrate Context
Proxy -> Nginx : Inject Bearer Access Token into Upstream Header
Nginx -> BFF : Forward Request with Hydrated Bearer Token
BFF -> BFF : Parse & Validate Stateless JWT Claims (iss, aud, RS256)
BFF -> Redis : Cache Active Application Session Map
BFF --> Nginx : Return User Profile Context Json
Nginx --> Angular : Forward 200 OK Context Response
Angular -> Browser : Mount Protected Core Dashboard View
@enduml